<!--
    Google "G" mark, official four-colour logo.

    Path data is byte-for-byte the same as web's GoogleIcon() in
    apps/web/app/login/page.tsx, on the same 18x18 viewport — so the glyph is
    identical across all three platforms rather than merely similar.

    Deliberately NOT a tinted/monochrome icon: Google's brand guidelines for
    "Sign in with Google" require the mark in its own colours on a neutral
    button, and a recoloured G is a common store-review rejection.
-->
